WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.812 --> 00:00:06.893
"Oh no!"

2
00:00:15.775 --> 00:00:16.776
cried the Ghost Bandit.

3
00:00:17.496 --> 00:00:18.576
He was covered in ink.

4
00:00:19.777 --> 00:00:21.297
Now Roxy could see the villain.

5
00:00:22.337 --> 00:00:23.458
He was tall and thin.

6
00:00:24.138 --> 00:00:25.338
He carried a large bag.

7
00:00:26.498 --> 00:00:28.039
A round object was on his back.

8
00:00:28.059 --> 00:00:32.540
"That's probably a battery for his suit," Roxy thought.

9
00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.261
"That's how he stays invisible."

10
00:00:35.281 --> 00:00:39.264
"You still won't catch me!"

11
00:00:39.565 --> 00:00:40.565
yelled the Ghost Bandit.

12
00:00:41.626 --> 00:00:43.047
He held up a small device.

13
00:00:44.128 --> 00:00:46.630
Shling! A claw shot out.

14
00:00:47.191 --> 00:00:48.412
It was attached to a cable.

15
00:00:49.112 --> 00:00:51.194
The claw hooked onto a windowsill high up.

16
00:00:52.355 --> 00:00:54.517
The Ghost Bandit pressed a button on the device.

17
00:00:55.678 --> 00:00:58.340
The cable quickly pulled the villain up to the windowsill.

18
00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:00.441
Roxy laughed.

19
00:01:00.461 --> 00:01:03.424
"You can't escape," she said.

20
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:06.761
"Police have the entire building surrounded."

21
00:01:07.861 --> 00:01:10.282
The Ghost Bandit looked down and saw all the police.

22
00:01:11.503 --> 00:01:13.044
Some news reporters had arrived too.

23
00:01:13.064 --> 00:01:16.545
"Ha!" cried the Ghost Bandit.

24
00:01:16.565 --> 00:01:18.706
"There's a fountain!"

25
00:01:21.007 --> 00:01:22.327
He fired the device again.

26
00:01:27.409 --> 00:01:28.710
Then he shot out the window.

27
00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:31.451
"Uh-oh!" said Roxy.

28
00:01:31.931 --> 00:01:33.452
She flew as fast as she could.

29
00:01:35.452 --> 00:01:38.334
Outside, she saw the Ghost Bandit zipping above the police.

30
00:01:39.654 --> 00:01:40.935
A police officer looked up.

31
00:01:40.955 --> 00:01:43.156
"There's the Ghost Bandit!"

32
00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:43.897
he cried.

33
00:01:44.977 --> 00:01:47.079
The Ghost Bandit was soon above the fountain.

34
00:01:48.079 --> 00:01:49.280
Roxy watched the villain.

35
00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:53.262
"If he lands in that water, he'll be invisible again!"

36
00:01:53.622 --> 00:01:54.142
she thought.

37
00:01:55.083 --> 00:01:56.544
The Ghost Bandit dropped down.

38
00:01:58.105 --> 00:02:00.006
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

39
00:02:01.206 --> 00:02:04.008
Whiz-hoo! The battery exploded.

40
00:02:05.848 --> 00:02:09.369
Splash! The Ghost Bandit leaped out of the fountain.

41
00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:15.791
He laughed.

42
00:02:15.811 --> 00:02:17.351
"Now you'll never catch me!

43
00:02:17.371 --> 00:02:20.072
I'll—oh no!"

44
00:02:21.132 --> 00:02:23.893
The Ghost Bandit saw his reflection in a store window.

45
00:02:23.913 --> 00:02:27.974
"My suit—it's ruined!"

46
00:02:30.835 --> 00:02:33.536
Roxy's friends were still watching TV in Jack's house.

47
00:02:34.508 --> 00:02:36.429
The news reporter was talking to Roxy.

48
00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:39.111
The Ghost Bandit was in handcuffs.

49
00:02:40.091 --> 00:02:42.292
Police officers were taking money out of the bag.

50
00:02:43.573 --> 00:02:45.314
"Rocket Girl," said the reporter.

51
00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:48.756
"Is that the villain you were chasing earlier today?"

52
00:02:52.558 --> 00:02:53.438
Roxy smiled.

53
00:02:53.458 --> 00:02:55.379
"That's the Ghost Bandit.

54
00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:57.320
He was invisible.

55
00:02:57.901 --> 00:02:59.261
But I finally caught him!"

56
00:02:59.281 --> 00:03:03.904
"So Rocket Girl is a good guy, folks," said the reporter.

57
00:03:04.872 --> 00:03:07.755
"And thanks to her, Metro City is safe once again!

58
00:03:08.795 --> 00:03:10.077
Now back to Mighty Man."

59
00:03:13.219 --> 00:03:16.042
"I knew Rocket Girl was innocent," said Terrell.

60
00:03:17.022 --> 00:03:18.203
Jack and Mara smiled.

61
00:03:18.223 --> 00:03:22.327
"I'm glad Rocket Girl isn't a bad guy," said Jack.

62
00:03:23.388 --> 00:03:24.649
Roxy walked into the room.

63
00:03:25.349 --> 00:03:26.550
She had a big smile.

64
00:03:27.831 --> 00:03:28.672
"Hey, everybody!

65
00:03:29.052 --> 00:03:29.573
I'm back."

66
00:03:30.574 --> 00:03:32.936
Terrell looked at the TV and then at Roxy.

67
00:03:33.917 --> 00:03:35.241
"Are you feeling better?"

68
00:03:36.365 --> 00:03:38.151
Roxy flopped onto the sofa.

69
00:03:38.171 --> 00:03:40.479
"I feel great!"
